{"articleNo":"40117","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=40117&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년 1학기 송암장학금 지원사업 실시안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.02.16","hit":"10662","attachments":[{"name":"송암장학금 장학지원서 및 추천서양식(3부).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=40117&attachNo=1580"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 5.2pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">2009</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">8</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">13</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">일 발족한 송암장학회는 한글점자 창안자 송암 박두성 선생의 시각장애인들에 대한 지극하신</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">사랑실천과 교육철학을 이어가기 위해 발족되었으며</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">우수한 한글점자를 연구？발전시키고 보급하는데</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">필요한 전문 인력을 양성하고자 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">2012</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">년도 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">학기 송암장학금지원사업을 아래와 같이 진행 하고자 합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">아 래 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">-</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">1. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">지원자격<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">국내 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">년제 대학에 재학 중인 시각장애 대학생으로 당해 학기 성적이 평균 평점 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">B+</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">이상인자로 다음 각 호 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">에 해당하는 자로 한다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">① 점자관련 과목을 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">학점 이상을 수강하여 학점을 취득한 자</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">② 민간공인 자격인정 점역？교정사 시험에 합격하여 점역？교정사 자격증을 취득한 자</span><br><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">※단, 위의 장학생선발기준에서 1항 혹은 2항의 기준에 적격자가 없을 경우에는 지원자 중에서 선발할 수 있다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">2. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">선발인원 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">국내 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">년제 시각장애 대학생 약간 명</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">3. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">지원서류<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">송암 장학금 지원신청서 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">1, 2 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">각 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">부</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">재학증명서</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">성적증명서</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">라</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">점자관련 과목 수강확인서</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">마</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">관련 증명서</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">바</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">추천서</span><br><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">※ 지원서</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">, </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">추천서는 홈페이지</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">(www.ibu.or.kr//www.ibusongam.or.kr)</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">에서 내려받아 사용<br>※ 추천서 </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">학과장</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">, </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">지도교수 또는 소속 학과 교수 추천</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">추천인 연락처 및 서명 등재</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">)</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">4. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">지원서 접수<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">접수처 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">인천광역시시각장애인복지관 정보문화팀 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">송암기념관 담당자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">접수방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: </span><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\" color=\"#0055ff\">우편 또는 이메일<br></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">접수기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">2012. 2. 6 (</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">) ~ 2012. 2. 21 (</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">화</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">까지</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">라</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">문의전화 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: 032)876-3500 (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">내선</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">245) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">담당자 허보나</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">금오공대 학생처 Tel : 054-478-7978</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">▶ 주소 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">우</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">402-040) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">인천광역시 남구 한나루로길 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">357</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">번지 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">105-19</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">번지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">학익동 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">709-1) / e-mail : </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><a href=\"mailto:ibu3500@ibu.or.kr\">ibu3500@ibu.or.kr</a></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">5. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">선발방법<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: 1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">차 서류 심사로 지원 자격 충족</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">서류 이상 유무</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">서류 충실도 등을 확인 후 결격 사유가 없는 학생을 대상으로 심사를 실시하여 선발 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 154%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 154%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">6. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">심사일정<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. 1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">차 서류 심사 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: 2012. 2. 22 (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">수</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">) ~ 2012. 2. 23 (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">목</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">최종 합격자 발표 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: 2012. 2. 24 (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">금</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">홈페이지 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 154%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#0055ff\">(<!--StartFragment--> <span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><a href=\"http://www.ibu.or.kr/\">http://www.ibu.or.kr/</a>&nbsp; </span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><a href=\"http://www.ibusongam.or.kr/\">http://www.ibusongam.or.kr</a> </span>) <br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">장학증서 전달 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">: 2012. 2. 27 (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">송암박두성기념관</span><br><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">※선발된 장학생은 반드시 참석</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">하여야 함</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">)</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">2012. 01. 26.</p><br><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">금오공과대학교 학생처</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
